    "description": "Jimeng Official API format video generation interface.\n\nSupports specifying operation type via Action parameter:\n- `CVSync2AsyncSubmitTask`: Submit video generation task\n- `CVSync2AsyncGetResult`: Get task result\n\nAction and Version need to be specified in query parameters.\n"
